 ### Peripheral Methods
 
-- `peripheral_advertise(ad_data)` - Start advertising
+- `peripheral_advertise(ad_data, min_interval = 800, max_interval = 800)` - Start advertising; intervals use 0.625 ms units
 - `notify(handle)` - Send notification
+- `indicate(handle)` - Send indication and return the BTstack status code
+- `csc_server_init(wheel, crank, sensor_location)` - Initialize the native BTstack CSCS server
+- `csc_server_update(wheel_delta, wheel_time, crank_delta, crank_time)` - Update and notify CSCS values
 - `pop_write_value(handle)` - Get value written by client
 - `push_read_value(handle, value)` - Set value for read request
 
